WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.075 --> 00:00:40.794
Ann led Tom to his lab.

2
00:00:40.795 --> 00:00:51.847
She showed him a tiny door.

3
00:00:51.848 --> 00:00:58.677
"The last wizard kept things in this secret room."

4
00:00:58.678 --> 00:01:02.076
Ann looked around the secret room.

5
00:01:02.077 --> 00:01:04.181
"We need a potion to—"

6
00:01:04.182 --> 00:01:07.442
Just then there was a soft meow.

7
00:01:07.443 --> 00:01:16.384
"Cat?" Tom said in surprise.

8
00:01:16.385 --> 00:01:20.621
"I found the secret door too," Cat said to Tom.

9
00:01:20.622 --> 00:01:28.491
"And look—I already found a potion!"

10
00:01:28.492 --> 00:01:31.948
Tom told Ann what Cat said.

11
00:01:31.949 --> 00:01:35.261
"Let's mix the potion," Ann said.

12
00:01:35.262 --> 00:01:37.640
"Huh?" Tom looked at her.

13
00:01:37.641 --> 00:01:44.648
"I love my father," Ann said.

14
00:01:44.649 --> 00:01:47.990
"But you have a kind heart, Tom.

15
00:01:47.991 --> 00:02:04.395
Father treats you and Cat unfairly."

16
00:02:04.396 --> 00:02:19.251
The next day the royal family returned.

17
00:02:19.252 --> 00:02:22.226
Tom bowed before the queen.

18
00:02:22.227 --> 00:02:25.955
"I missed Your Highness greatly," he said.

19
00:02:25.956 --> 00:02:28.618
Then Tom held out a cup.

20
00:02:28.619 --> 00:02:33.380
"I made a royal potion for you."

21
00:02:33.381 --> 00:02:36.415
"Why, Tom!" The queen blushed.

22
00:02:36.416 --> 00:02:38.189
"Thank you!"

23
00:02:38.190 --> 00:02:49.128
The queen gulped down the potion.

24
00:02:49.129 --> 00:02:52.600
Tom held his breath as Cat appeared.

25
00:02:52.601 --> 00:02:54.422
Dirk scowled.

26
00:02:54.423 --> 00:02:57.309
"You'll be gone soon, Wizard!"

27
00:02:57.310 --> 00:03:00.637
"What's going on?" the king shouted.

28
00:03:00.638 --> 00:03:05.844
Everyone watched the queen.

29
00:03:05.845 --> 00:03:14.516
"Ah—" She gasped but she didn't sneeze.

30
00:03:14.517 --> 00:03:19.492
"You cured me, Tom!" she said happily.

31
00:03:19.493 --> 00:03:25.247
She petted Cat.

32
00:03:25.248 --> 00:03:31.390
"Let there be cats in the palace!" shouted the king.

33
00:03:31.391 --> 00:03:48.161
Dirk stomped away as everyone cheered.
